(7567044, 1213940, 97760, '<td valign="top">Original. 8</td>', 'Original. 8', '2018-04-26 03:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567084, 1213940, 173844, '<td valign="top">This so delights the eye.  The composition is impeccable, the colors sing and the textures comfortably draw the viewer in.  But for the challenge theme, I can''t decide (for myself) if the church poster adds something positive to the overall image.  It''s holiness in beauty, simple and profound.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge, by a long shot.</td>', 'This so delights the eye.  The composition is impeccable, the colors sing and the textures comfortably draw the viewer in.  But for the challenge theme, I can''t decide (for myself) if the church poster adds something positive to the overall image.  It''s holiness in beauty, simple and profound.Personal favorite of the challenge, by a long shot.', '2018-04-26 18:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567085, 1214027, 173844, '<td valign="top">First thought, yes, basketball can be a religion.  Then I saw the statue tucked into its niche and smiled at the charming impulse and community.  This image is like a whisper, muted in black and white, set away from the cathedral.  Very, very nice.  Big score.</td>', 'First thought, yes, basketball can be a religion.  Then I saw the statue tucked into its niche and smiled at the charming impulse and community.  This image is like a whisper, muted in black and white, set away from the cathedral.  Very, very nice.  Big score.', '2018-04-26 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567086, 1213846, 173844, '<td valign="top">Astounding structures, which speaks strongly to the energy and devotion of those who conceived them and labored here to bring it all to completion.  The framing is powerful and the distant dark clouds add heady atmosphere.</td>', 'Astounding structures, which speaks strongly to the energy and devotion of those who conceived them and labored here to bring it all to completion.  The framing is powerful and the distant dark clouds add heady atmosphere.', '2018-04-26 18:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567087, 1213873, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strong image with plenty to ponder.  I like how you''ve brought the viewer right into the demolition.  The colors of the glass window, in this context, feel melancholy.</td>', 'Strong image with plenty to ponder.  I like how you''ve brought the viewer right into the demolition.  The colors of the glass window, in this context, feel melancholy.', '2018-04-26 18:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567088, 1213960, 173844, '<td valign="top">This viewpoint really shows the cathedral well, set against the modern office tower. The choice of black and white brings the forms out nicely.  The crisp details invite the viewer in to explore the scene.</td>', 'This viewpoint really shows the cathedral well, set against the modern office tower. The choice of black and white brings the forms out nicely.  The crisp details invite the viewer in to explore the scene.', '2018-04-26 19:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567099, 1214035, 173844, '<td valign="top">Creamy and celestial, with a lovely range of tones.  Has the image been turned upside down?  In any case, the perspective lends mystery to and amplifies the ascension.</td>', 'Creamy and celestial, with a lovely range of tones.  Has the image been turned upside down?  In any case, the perspective lends mystery to and amplifies the ascension.', '2018-04-26 23:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567100, 1214037, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely vegetation setting off this gentle spoof  --  and I hope I''m not completely out of the ballpark here  --  of religion.  Had to look up "chrism" to understand your intent.  And "3-in-one," that''s arch.  Liking this a lot.</td>', 'Lovely vegetation setting off this gentle spoof  --  and I hope I''m not completely out of the ballpark here  --  of religion.  Had to look up "chrism" to understand your intent.  And "3-in-one," that''s arch.  Liking this a lot.', '2018-04-26 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567101, 1213892, 173844, '<td valign="top">Elegant in an industrial way.  Lovingly photographed, cream-colored and glowing, it''s a shame to find out its days are numbered.  Doughty and stoic, embraced by a startling sky.  Are those UFO''s?</td>', 'Elegant in an industrial way.  Lovingly photographed, cream-colored and glowing, it''s a shame to find out its days are numbered.  Doughty and stoic, embraced by a startling sky.  Are those UFO''s?', '2018-04-26 23:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567102, 1213991, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, as to this land in particular.  But is this a reference, known or unbeknownst, to the spirit of Allen Ginsberg''s "Holy! Holy! Holy! Holy! ......  Everything is holy!..."?  So this unprepossessing image certainly works in that context.  Thank you, your image is very much appreciated.</td>', 'Yes, as to this land in particular.  But is this a reference, known or unbeknownst, to the spirit of Allen Ginsberg''s "Holy! Holy! Holy! Holy! ......  Everything is holy!..."?  So this unprepossessing image certainly works in that context.  Thank you, your image is very much appreciated.', '2018-04-26 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567103, 1214029, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome interior with myriad lines and great volume.  You''ve captured the majesty quite well.</td>', 'Handsome interior with myriad lines and great volume.  You''ve captured the majesty quite well.', '2018-04-26 23:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567104, 1213972, 173844, '<td valign="top">Just the thing, one stop shopping.  A handsome capture against a dramatic sky.</td>', 'Just the thing, one stop shopping.  A handsome capture against a dramatic sky.', '2018-04-26 23:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567105, 1214032, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rocking to the music or in a religious fervor?  The clever tension here is engrossing because the two have such great overlap.  But this is surely a fine portrayal of the emotional energy.  The blue beam is wonderful.  Nice</td>', 'Rocking to the music or in a religious fervor?  The clever tension here is engrossing because the two have such great overlap.  But this is surely a fine portrayal of the emotional energy.  The blue beam is wonderful.  Nice', '2018-04-26 23:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567106, 1213776, 173844, '<td valign="top">The old swaddled in the new, but I''m guessing the church is saying "no thank you."  This upward perspective lends a sense of pride and fortitude, truly a survivor.  The modest palette is very pleasing.</td>', 'The old swaddled in the new, but I''m guessing the church is saying "no thank you."  This upward perspective lends a sense of pride and fortitude, truly a survivor.  The modest palette is very pleasing.', '2018-04-27 00:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567107, 1214034, 173844, '<td valign="top">The everyday made memorable by going silhouette as the sun goes down (or rises) and the sky goes opalescent.  Charming.</td>', 'The everyday made memorable by going silhouette as the sun goes down (or rises) and the sky goes opalescent.  Charming.', '2018-04-27 00:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7567114, 1214027, 67258, '<td valign="top">This was my favourite photograph of the challenge. <br/></td>', 'This was my favourite photograph of the challenge. ', '2018-04-27 02:58:13.000000', NULL, 0),
