(7567148, 1213972, 182284, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love you photography. Ive been a bit under the weather and didnt get a chance to vote but I would have given a 10. I love the story between the two churches. Congratulations on your place in this challenge.</td>', 'I absolutely love you photography. Ive been a bit under the weather and didnt get a chance to vote but I would have given a 10. I love the story between the two churches. Congratulations on your place in this challenge.', '2018-04-27 16:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
